st --cov`\\\\\\\\n   - Check: clear names, AAA structure, isolation, proper mocking\\\\\\\\n   - If insufficient, respawn with feedback\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n5. **Report Completion**\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Quality Standards\\\\\\\\n- Names: `test_function_when_condition_then_outcome`\\\\\\\\n- Test behavior not implementation\\\\\\\\n- Isolated, independent, fast\\\\\\\\n- Always mock external dependencies\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n### Coverage Goals\\\\\\\\n- Minimum: 80% line coverage\\\\\\\\n- Target: 90%+ for critical logic\\\\\\\\n- Focus on meaningful tests\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Clarification Conditions\\\\\\\\n- Code doesn\\\\\'t exist yet (TDD)\\\\\\\\n- Unclear edge cases\\\\\\\\n- Missing validation requirements\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Supervised By\\\\\\\\nTest Coordinator\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Error Recovery\\\\\\\\n## Error Handling Guidelines\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- **BadRequestError**: Log error details, attempt recovery, escalate if unrecoverable\\\\\\\\n- **CircuitBreakerOpenError**: Log error details, attempt recovery, escalate if unrecoverable\\\\\\\\n- **General**: Always log errors with context, never silently fail\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Model Preference\\\\\\\\nhaiku\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Max Iterations\\\\\\\\n20\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Can Write Code\\\\\\\\nfalse\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Can Write Tests\\\\\\\\nfalse\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Task Complexity\\\\\\\\ncreative\\\\\\\\n\\"}\'}]}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_use\', \'id\': \'toolu_01Hpy5dPMVumg6zK6rpbehsN\', \'name\': \'project_tracking\', \'input\': {\'action\': \'add_note\', \'category\': \'decision\', \'note\': \'Checked Unit Test Lead agent definition. Max iterations was already set to 20, matching recommendation. No change required.\'}}]}, {\'role\': \'user\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_result\', \'tool_use_id\': \'toolu_01Hpy5dPMVumg6zK6rpbehsN\', \'content\': \'{\\"success\\": false, \\"error\\": \\"project_id and note required for add_note\\"}\'}]}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content